## Context

Necessary child of [[1654]], following the conditional Astra migration-copy
framework. A proven historical append occurrence may have gained unauthorized
selection precedence; its substantive native judgment is not thereby wrong.
Actual occurrence attribution and any active registry require a separate root
release. This child never changes raw scientific ledgers or activates a remedy.

## Scope

Fourteen paths maximum: this ticket; scripts/_rel_selection.py;
scripts/_icf_chunks.py; scripts/corpus_icf_stage1_input.py;
scripts/corpus_rel_view.py; scripts/corpus_rel_policy.py;
scripts/corpus_icf_stage2.py; scripts/corpus_rel_discipline_catchup.py;
scripts/corpus_icf_import.py; scripts/corpus_rel_repec_prefilter.py;
config/rel_screen.yaml; tests/test_rel_selection.py;
docs/rel-intake-contract.md; linked script-I/O follow-up [[2029]].

## Relevant files

Raw append contracts: scripts/_icf_screen.py, scripts/_rel_facet_io.py.
Native/effective scientific selection: scripts/_rel_view.py,
scripts/_rel_reasons.py, scripts/_rel_policy.py. These in-memory and raw
contracts must retain their established decision semantics.

## Test

Synthetic original A and original B plus a proven copied A-to-B occurrence:
exclude only that occurrence before the unchanged matcher/selection rules.
Prove duplicate contents at other ordinals remain eligible, raw ledgers and
append idempotence are unchanged, and source/prefix/multiplicity/approval
ambiguity refuses selection. No real exclusion roster or model request.

## Exit criteria

- Explicit shared effective-read API validates a versioned operator-approved
  registry with method/registry/evidence/disposition bindings, source baseline,
  immutable target CSV and append-manifest prefixes, source/target ordinals,
  exact raw-row and declared-transform hashes, multiplicities and independent
  migration provenance. Unresolved, malformed, stale or ambiguous evidence
  stops before selected outputs. Only declared key plus normal derived-ID
  substitution is permitted; all assessment fields remain identical.
- Every actual ICF, dimension, facet and policy scientific file consumer uses
  this eligibility boundary. Existing raw reads, manifest verification, raw
  append uniqueness and idempotence remain raw. Originals, genuine one-to-one
  copies, aliases, chronology, legacy membership and quality guards survive.
- Normal derived selection/view/request evidence binds the selector method and
  registry; stale binding checks fail closed. Raw/eligible/excluded occurrences
  reconcile separately from matched/unmatched rows, preserving multiplicity.
- Native-free meaningful regression tests cover A/B selection changed and
  unchanged cases, identical-content distinct occurrences, authorized copy
  preservation, original field bytes, alias/joint selection, registry ordering,
  append-prefix continuation, wrong hashes/ordinals/source/provenance and all
  routed consumers. No blanket many-to-one or label-based dropping.
- Config defaults keep quarantine disabled. Actual scientific/native tables,
  historic migration artifacts, jobs, model/profile and authority remain
  untouched; a real registry inside the existing rel_screen DVC package needs
  root's separate attribution release and downstream delta audit.
- Full make check passes once in the final clean, populated padme worktree;
  scoped ticket checks pass, branch pushed and PR reviewable. No merge or
  actual-data remedy is authorized by this ticket.
